71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=21U6W-IqOfwQ7kNvwFK9uIp&_nc_oc=Adoeth55VdycaxwvAM2xxBEsLORuoABhph3kC1cWwmcQ4oVj3txyTaT3RKIWzlD6JXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEJR1tN8dGZHAHd1oT_FF5WkoFhu5wcbfiemVZAV94uJg&oe=6A973F39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=06_v2JfDzXQQ7kNvwHi6s-r&_nc_oc=Adp7O339cSeRuK5mpTKVfFkYy-rQyFxVSSK1XT6nPomWjRDQ0JsLZDKtZ_hTRrEoKVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpgOjtByMvfqSFOkTxpmL4cnClNulnFCXw3O5pBicX-A&oe=6A975213"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-K_VRrqL7UQ7kNvwGUBGiL&_nc_oc=Adp4w6jC-RT2P56YxM-Cx-ba_XBYnIHeI7WGOQSrJN_JPioLTOEd5MUcKSwcx7xxPXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEFwCJN4ISN4Zx1qBBAPxR9fR0y0IdkbCozxliRFD5Jqg&oe=6A97505A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: